{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113100","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1111310001:0":{"text":"この雛たちの親鳥はみんな戦いで……とにかく、可哀想だったからよ、サンドクローの所から連れ出してきたんだ。","source_cn":"这些小陆行鸟的爸妈都在战争中……唉，我看它们太可怜……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4750201BB20A8C1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111310002:1":{"text":"でもここの環境に慣れないのか、しょっちゅう逃げ出すんだ。別に、傷つけたりはしねぇってのによ……","source_cn":"但它们不太适应这里，总想着逃跑。可我没想伤害它们，我是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50E3B4E36DD162F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111310003:0":{"text":"あんたはバードマウントが大好きなんだな。","source_cn":"诡草，你很喜欢陆行鸟啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D8EA55B9A283516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111310004:1":{"text":"へへっ、あたしがリーフベアーを大好きなのと一緒だね！","source_cn":"嘿嘿！我懂，我也很喜欢叶角熊呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x991E975F9C7BB62B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111310005:1":{"text":"バードマウントだけじゃねぇぜ、俺様は動物ならなんだって好きだ！あいつらは何でも知ってる、なんなら俺様たちよりもな！","source_cn":"不止是陆行鸟，我喜欢所有动物！它们很有灵性，什么都懂，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09B186772291E3D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111310006:0":{"text":"俺様の相棒の熾翼のアサルターは、危険を感知できるんだ。おかげで何度も命を助けられたぜ。","source_cn":"我的坐骑叫炽翼冲锋者，它经常能预感到危险，救了我好几次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0267200695707E39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111310007:1":{"text":"バードマウントは、俺様の最高の相棒さ。","source_cn":"这些陆行鸟，是我最好的伙伴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6408AE9EF347F876","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111310008:0":{"text":"お前が手伝ってくれるとは思わなかったよ……その、あ、ありがとな。","source_cn":"那个……我没想到你们会帮忙，谢、谢谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x741F51F05FAE73CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111310009:0":{"text":"礼はいらない。","source_cn":"免了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DEF5B1EC9C4FA09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111310010:1":{"text":"仲間がケガしたんだろ？ここで休んでけよ。それに今夜はパーティーだ。うまいもんがたらふく食えるぜ！","source_cn":"你们的伙伴，受伤了对吧？留下休养吧，今晚会有热闹的宴会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4C2EE2312C6671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"